{"id":31068506603,"name":"Test","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAHO9PJ6w","head_branch":"claude/nplus1-10-preload-category-collections","head_sha":"f067077a896547da1ddbb2ab8e7626081c45be67","path":".github/workflows/run-tests.yml","run_number":55420,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"perf: preload the category-combo associations the data-entry metadata export reads","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":10954,"check_suite_id":84272054108,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAATnwF_XA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31068506603","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31068506603","created_at":"2026-08-06T03:27:56Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T03:42:38Z","run_started_at":"2026-08-06T03:27:56Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31068506603/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31068506603/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/84272054108","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31068506603/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31068506603/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31068506603/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"perf: preload the category-combo associations the data-entry metadata export reads\n\nGET /api/dataEntry/metadata still initialised three lazy collections one parent\nat a time after the bounded-query rewrite: CategoryCombo.categories and\nCategory.categoryOptions while gathering, CategoryCombo.optionCombos while\nserialising. On Uganda's closure that is 345 of the endpoint's 533 queries.\n\nCategoryService.getCategoryOptionCombosWithCategoryOptions becomes\npreloadCategoryComboAssociations, which fetch-joins all four collections in\nthree queries instead of the one it did before. The queries cannot be merged:\ncategories and optionCombos are independent collections of CategoryCombo, and\nCategoryOptionCombo.hashCode() reads categoryOptions, so filling the\noptionCombos Set before those options are in the session fails outright.\n\nMeasured on a Postgres fixture, 120 category combos: 390 -\u003e 32 selects and\n246 -\u003e 127 ms. Guarded by two new cases in the existing query-count test — one\nthat the select count does not grow with the number of category combos, one\nthat the fetch joins keep the exported categories in sort order.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"stian-sandvold","email":"stian@dhis2.org"},"id":"f067077a896547da1ddbb2ab8e7626081c45be67","tree_id":"77e1fc10d64449751de69f69203a779890344b46","timestamp":"2026-08-05T21:07:51Z","committer":{"name":"stian-sandvold","email":"stian@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written 